    "body": "#13301 makes SVG `title`'s content model text, and #13300 parses SVG and MathML `title`, `style`, `script` and `noscript` as RCDATA, with SVG `title` no longer an HTML integration point. So I think:\n\n- \"Allow `<template>` elements as children of SVG elements (other than `script` and `style`)\" should also exclude `title`.\n- \"Resolve a parser context namespace\" shouldn't return the HTML namespace for SVG `title` once #13300 lands. For a `<template for>` target that's one of these elements, the namespace hardly matters, since #13300 doesn't insert element children there.\n",
